    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter the world of Everhood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the color of your soul and what lies beyond the river of death in a strange land. Accompany a mysterious celestial Raven who has deemed you worthy of slaying the Mind Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.poster.avif?t=1753345872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.webm?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.mp4?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the music-based battles with over 100 songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voyage through a transcendental journey across 10-12 hours </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a wild universe with mind-bending visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer the unconquerable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom World &amp; Battle Editor Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make funny friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/69a757ee74fa1340291adea8c58b4589.poster.avif?t=1753345872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/69a757ee74fa1340291adea8c58b4589.webm?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/69a757ee74fa1340291adea8c58b4589.mp4?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>WARNING: The game contains imagery that may be harmful to players with photosensitive epilepsy, those can be disabled in the Accessibility Menu included in the game.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter the world of Everhood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the color of your soul and what lies beyond the river of death in a strange land. Accompany a mysterious celestial Raven who has deemed you worthy of slaying the Mind Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.poster.avif?t=1753345872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.webm?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/f0cf13ff18dfcae51f2af00004777a3d.mp4?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the music-based battles with over 100 songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voyage through a transcendental journey across 10-12 hours </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a wild universe with mind-bending visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer the unconquerable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom World &amp; Battle Editor Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make funny friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/69a757ee74fa1340291adea8c58b4589.poster.avif?t=1753345872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984020/extras/69a757ee74fa1340291adea8c58b4589.webm?t=1753345872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.